      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just to sanity check outloud: the old yaml encoder also supports comments, but they are not wired up in the yaml filetype (https://github.com/cue-lang/cue/issues/1180, github.com/cue-lang/cue/pull/1549), which is why `cue export --out yaml` doesn\u0027t include comments today.\n\nThis will remain being the case. And it\u0027s good to include comment support for parity with the old encoder.\n\nPlease say if I got this wrong.",
